#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. こんな物…厨房にまで置かなくったって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. Why\n"
"does there need to be one in the kitchen...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. こんな物…厨房にまで置かなくったって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera... Why does there need to be one\n"
"in the kitchen...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Một cái camera giám sát... Tại sao ngay cả trong nhà bếp cũng\n"
"cần có một cái cơ chứ...?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>包丁は、ひとつ欠けたままだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Not surprisingly, one of the knives is still missing.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの時の…舞園さんの事件から、
#. すべてが始まったんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It all began then...with Sayaka's case...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ショーケースだ…
#. 中には、食材が並んでいる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a deli-style display case. There's all kinds of\n"
"food and stuff lined up inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Đây là tủ trưng bày thực phẩm. Có đủ loại thức ăn và các\n"
"thứ được xếp bên trong...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>でも、ここでの食事ともおさらばだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I'm gonna say farewell to any more meals here!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>野菜が山積みになっている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a bunch of vegetables all piled up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、ここでの食事ともおさらばだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I'm gonna say farewell to any more meals here!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>厨房から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the kitchen?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi nhà bếp?\n"
"<CLT>"
